Package: forecastsuite
Title: Multi-Model Time Series Forecasting Toolkit and Local App
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: person("Mukul", "Maheshwari", email = "ryan00700@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1918-5100"))
Description: Extends the Forecast Dashboard's Prophet/ARIMA workflow with a
    pluggable model registry (ARIMA, SARIMA, ETS, TBATS, NNETAR, Holt-Winters,
    and optional Prophet and LSTM via the prophet and torch packages) and a
    bundled local Shiny app exposing all models without the hosted app's
    memory-conserving constraints.
